  "_comment": [
    "The live production column list for every relation in `public`, captured 2026-08-08.",
    "",
    "This exists because `roles` proved that a generated TypeScript definition is not",
    "evidence. `src/lib/database.types.ts` is produced from a schema; when the schema and",
    "the application disagree, a generated type agrees with whichever one produced it and",
    "the mismatch typechecks cleanly. `roles.badge_icon`, `roles.label` and `roles.priority`",
    "were all referenced by shipped code and none of the three has ever existed.",
    "",
    "Regenerate with:",
    "  select json_object_agg(table_name, cols order by table_name)",
    "  from (select table_name, json_agg(column_name order by column_name) as cols",
    "        from information_schema.columns where table_schema='public'",
    "        group by table_name) t;",
    "",
    "Refresh this deliberately, as part of applying a migration — never to make a red test",
    "go green. A column appearing here that no migration creates is itself the finding."
  ],
